evision: 2024-08-26\nValid as Of: 2024-08-26\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 2345 ---\nComponent: SAP Build Process Automation\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: New API Scopes for Shared Environment\nDescription: New API scopes have been added for your shared environment. Navigate to Control Tower  Others  API Keys to view. You can use shared environment scopes to generate API keys only in the shared environment.  See API Keys.\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: New\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2024-08-26\nValid as Of: 2024-08-26\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 2346 ---\nComponent: SAP HANA Spatial Services\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry,Kyma\nTitle: nan\nDescription:     Enhancements: Mapping API, Routing API, Geocoding API  Security updates have been implemented.    \nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: Changed\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2024-01-01\nValid as Of: 2024-08-26\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 2347 ---\nComponent: SAP Intelligent Robotic Process Automation\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: Microsoft 365 Cloud SDK - OneNote\nDescription: Various Microsoft OneNote activities are added to enhance the Microsoft 365 SDK. You can now use the Get Notebook List activity to retrieve the list of a notebook of the current authenticated user, the Create Notebook activity to create a notebook, the Delete Notebook activity to delete a notebook, the Get Section List activity to retrieve a list of sections of a notebook, the Create Section activity to create the section of a notebook, the Get Page List activity to retrieve the list of pages of a section, the Get Page Content activity to retrieve the content of a page, the Create Page activity to create a page inside the section of a notebook, the Update Page activity to update a page inside the section of a notebook, the Delete Page activity delete a page inside the section of a notebook. See Microsoft 365 Cloud SDK - OneNote.\nAction: Inf